{"text":"Well, if you look back in the last 10 years, we've actually seen that the story around productivity has been, certainly in the developed world, pretty depressing. We've seen declines, and this is, in some cases, even when there has been growth, it's been pretty paltry. And the concerns around this in particular, vis-a-vis productivity, is why is our ability as individuals or as workers, why has it declined or stalled or certainly not grown very rapidly in a period of technology? So put another way, because we're in an era of technology, we'd expect our ability to work more, to produce more, certainly in terms of a GNP or GDP number. But what we have seen in a broad sense, even though there have been some improvements in some places recently, is a decline.","words":[{"text":"Well","start":0.0,"end":0.76,"punct":","},{"text":"if","start":1.2,"end":1.38},{"text":"you","start":1.38,"end":1.5},{"text":"look","start":1.5,"end":1.7},{"text":"back","start":1.7,"end":2.08},{"text":"in","start":2.08,"end":2.36},{"text":"the","start":2.36,"end":2.46},{"text":"last","start":2.46,"end":2.68},{"text":"10","start":2.68,"end":2.96},{"text":"years","start":2.96,"end":3.22,"punct":","},{"text":"we've","start":3.42,"end":3.52},{"text":"actually","start":3.52,"end":3.88},{"text":"seen","start":3.88,"end":4.36},{"text":"that","start":4.36,"end":4.88},{"text":"the","start":4.88,"end":5.02},{"text":"story","start":5.02,"end":5.38},{"text":"around","start":5.38,"end":5.68},{"text":"productivity","start":5.68,"end":6.22},{"text":"has","start":6.22,"end":6.68},{"text":"been","start":6.68,"end":7.06,"punct":","},{"text":"certainly","start":7.64,"end":8.0},{"text":"in","start":8.0,"end":8.22},{"text":"the","start":8.22,"end":8.3},{"text":"developed","start":8.3,"end":8.64},{"text":"world","start":8.64,"end":9.14,"punct":","},{"text":"pretty","start":10.12,"end":10.28},{"text":"depressing","start":10.28,"end":12.52,"punct":"."},{"text":"We've","start":13.4,"end":13.68},{"text":"seen","